    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia** · [project thread](https://claude.ai/code/project/chan_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2?thread=cmsg_01KaQfLZaF43QUMN3kcT7pW2AH1ExRWLcy6KeFaJvkbr1Z)_\n\n## What\n`sp-org-lint-fn-backup-directory` pointed at `sp-org-lint-backups/` in the config folder, so the backup copies appeared in Git. It now defaults to `org-lint-backups/` under `sp-var-dir`.\n\n## Notes\n- `var/` is already in the `.gitignore` of `.config/emacs-modular`, and no backup file was tracked, so nothing needed `git rm`.\n- Module, literate doc (backup bullet and \"Changes by pull request\") and CHANGELOG updated.\n- The old `sp-org-lint-backups/` folder on the machine can be deleted by hand.\n\n## Not tested\nNo Emacs in the container; nothing was run.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9tUgxJoT7DzmuyzPU)_",
